//!
//! Run: `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=... cargo test -p paigasus-helikon-providers-anthropic -- --ignored live_`
//! Optional: `ANTHROPIC_LIVE_MODEL_ID` (default `claude-sonnet-5-5`, used with
